[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11765.429, "timestamp": "03:16:05", "text": "このゲームは結構楽しい。これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11767.269, "timestamp": "03:16:07", "text": "これは、えーと、ところでこれは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11771.19, "timestamp": "03:16:11", "text": "NRAのヴァージンと呼ばれています。これはデモです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11773.429, "timestamp": "03:16:13", "text": "でも、デモとしてはかなり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11776.389, "timestamp": "03:16:16", "text": "最高だよ、マジで。なかなか良いですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11777.389, "timestamp": "03:16:17", "text": "しないよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.99, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "嘘。きれい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11783.349, "timestamp": "03:16:23", "text": "良い。自分で試してみてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11791.51, "timestamp": "03:16:31", "text": "私は魚を３匹殺して戻ってきました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11793.15, "timestamp": "03:16:33", "text": "たくさんの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11797.55, "timestamp": "03:16:37", "text": "海藻。海藻を持ってきます、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11809.67, "timestamp": "03:16:49", "text": "とにかく、寝袋を作らなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11817.469, "timestamp": "03:16:57", "text": "どこにあるの"}]